=== product binds tighter than sum ===
:parse(Lumo)

fn t() = 1 + 2 * 3

---

(FILE (FN_DECL (EXPR_INFIX (NUMBER_EXPR) (EXPR_INFIX (NUMBER_EXPR) (NUMBER_EXPR)))))

=== sum is left-associative ===
:parse(Lumo)

fn t() = 1 - 2 - 3

---

(FILE (FN_DECL (EXPR_INFIX (EXPR_INFIX (NUMBER_EXPR) (NUMBER_EXPR)) (NUMBER_EXPR))))

=== power is right-associative ===
:parse(Lumo)

fn t() = 2 ** 3 ** 4

---

(FILE (FN_DECL (EXPR_INFIX (NUMBER_EXPR) (EXPR_INFIX (NUMBER_EXPR) (NUMBER_EXPR)))))

